{"id":"2e2e732d8f4da09d","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set.md","title":"ZFC Map Fiber Set","display":"df-zfc-map-fiber-set — ZFC Map Fiber Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set"],"display":"df-zfc-map-fiber-set — ZFC Map Fiber Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-map-fiber-set — ZFC Map Fiber Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,f,X,Y,b\\in V\">\\(F,f,X,Y,b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}fiber\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S(F,f,X,Y,b)\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land b\\in Y\\land F=\\{a\\in X\\mid f(a)=b\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}fiber\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S(F,f,X,Y,b)\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land b\\in Y\\land F=\\{a\\in X\\mid f(a)=b\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The map's domain and codomain are explicit, and the fiber is taken over a codomain element.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,f,X,Y,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}map\\text{-}fiber\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapFiberSet}_S(F,f,X,Y,b)\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land b\\in Y\\land F=\\{a\\in X\\mid f(a)=b\\}","display":true}],"bytes":685,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2511","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set.md|58-df-zfc-map-fiber-set]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}